subckt pll_inv_pdk110_23 (a y vdd vss)
MN (y a vss vss) nch w=8e-07 l=1.8e-07 nf=1 ad=3.84e-13 as=3.84e-13 pd=2.56e-06 ps=2.56e-06 nrd=0.3375 nrs=0.3375 sa=4.8e-07 sb=4.8e-07 sd=5.4e-07 sca=0 scb=0 scc=0
MP (y a vdd vdd) pch w=5e-07 l=1.8e-07 nf=1 ad=2.4e-13 as=2.4e-13 pd=1.96e-06 ps=1.96e-06 nrd=0.54 nrs=0.54 sa=4.8e-07 sb=4.8e-07 sd=5.4e-07 sca=0 scb=0 scc=0
